==Overview==
'''Dual Rocket Launcher Toilet''' is a slow enemy with a lot of health that can stun units. It appears in [[Nightmare Mode|nightmare mode]].

==Appearance ==
It has two rockets on its sides and a helicopter rotor. It also is a dark toilet.
==Health ==
???

==Strategy==
*The '''Dual Rocket Launcher Toilet''' is a strong toilet, so high DPS units are recommended to take this down. This toilet also stuns units very frequently as it has 2 rockets. You can use Medic Cameraman or Camera Repair Drone to unstun units that are stunned by this enemy. You can use Level 5/6 Upgraded Titan Cameraman, TV Woman, or Mech Cameraman to slow this enemy down, making it an easier target.

== Facts ==
It is based off of the [[https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Dual%20Launcher%20Helicopter%20Skibidi%20Toilet Dual Rocket Launcher Toilet]]
 
